# FOSSIL FEUD: proof the game can be completed. The demo player plays from
# the title with real button presses: the story, all three moults (the
# ending after the full plume) and all five ordeals, starting a match
# again after any it loses, until every scenario is won.
seed 5
game fossilfeud
wait 10
botuntil save_beaten >= 7 2000000
expect goals & 2
botuntil save_beaten == 255 3000000
expect goals & 4
expect save_wins >= 8
